ml","text":"Write a slice as the entire contents of a file.","blocks":null,"service_name":"doc.rust-lang.org","service_icon":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/fs/fn.write.html","original_url":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/fs/fn.write.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+lVZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b81f690-435f-449d-be85-b898e3e0b4db","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"`Result\u0026lt;(), E\u0026gt;`が通例なのでは","ts":"1628339793.288600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yHt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0231b8de-d965-4152-8f2c-e721490a2ab7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それかResultのTをUnit型にしてしまうか","ts":"1628339790.288500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jq="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae0dc751-237b-4362-87bd-8f3c28a795d6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ErrorをOptionで包む？","ts":"1628339765.287700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G43MT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ae80b72-34dc-41e9-b261-c9e1b24ec3ad","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Rustは `Result\u0026lt;T, E\u0026gt;` 型があると思いますが、バリデーションメソッドで成功したときは何も返さないが、エラーを返すことはある。という関数の返り値はなにを採用すべきでしょうか？","ts":"1628339728.286900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WRkc"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"\u003c@UGN0T63GC\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628323519.286500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0aaca2cd-2358-4c38-8664-c774f69253ae","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あとtests/に書いてはいけないのかというのを見て、実際私が今書いているのは単体テストではなく結合テストなので、各ファイルに置くんじゃなくtests/に起くテストかもしれないと思いました。","ts":"1628323466.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VC0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a80ec94e-4f8f-4492-98d5-ded2e52f6b62","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。lib.rsにはpub mod foo;しか書いてはいけないものかと。。()\nそういう方法もあるんですね!","ts":"1628323371.286000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R1Rsu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b4e7de1-3699-4109-b810-e322eb422637","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"textual scopeとして","ts":"1628323319.285800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pkh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8e45515-adc3-42c5-9f62-77314a63b9e2","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"\u003chttp://まあモジュール空間にマウントしなくてもlib.rs/main.rsの上らへんに書いておけばクレート全体で利用できるはずです|xn--lib-j63brc3bwg4ah2qyb92awhki5l6bucyg3g5gu719mouie.rs/main.rsの上らへんに書いておけばクレート全体で利用できるはずです\u003e","ts":"1628323303.285600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"th2yo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbabf77b-01a6-4239-8be4-130ee8614ac7","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"(これについてのドキュメントが見当らず。通常のマクロの名前空間についてのものは\u003chttps://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/reference/macros-by-example.html|これ\u003eなのですが、「textual scopeのマクロは`use`して名前空間にマウントすることができる」という記述が発見できず)","ts":"1628323068.283800","edited":{"user":"U023FALTWDD","ts":"1628323127.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I7Ps"}]},{"client_msg_id":"020c9a06-0bd5-4ca1-8552-a89b8f528565","type":"message","user":"U023FALTWDD","text":"```pub(crate) mod certain_function {\n    #[cfg(test)]\n    mod tests {\n        use crate::macros::m;\n\n        m!();\n    }\n}\n\npub(crate) mod macros {\n    macro_rules! m(() =\u0026gt; (::std::compile_error!(\"TODO\");));\n\n    // \"textual scope\"のマクロも`use`することで名前空間にマウントすることができる\n    pub(crate) use m;\n}```","ts":"1628322998.282900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5rr6F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9427858e-b7c8-4175-ba65-c5e06b9567b2","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"普通にtestsフォルダの中に作るのは駄目なんでしたっけ？","ts":"1628322855.282400","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1628323000.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IUfT0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b10b1eb9-4b60-445a-be1e-3c67ed5f3f73","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"テストだけでしか使わない `macro_rules` があるのですが、どこに宣言してどう `use` すれば良いのでしょう？\nテストだけでしか使いませんが、複数のモジュールで使いたいのでどこかにまとめて定義しておきたい気持ちがあります。","ts":"1628322381.281700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gzT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e72b7e3b-4c86-4c69-a392-a6b3b6c313ec","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"分かり手","ts":"1628312793.281200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"162jb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8301619e-96ea-463c-a65e-46eba0f19227","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"検索でゲームの方ばかり出てきて検索に困りがち","ts":"1628312075.280600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UEB0VGD7E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IuwrQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf4e75b0-2761-462d-a71f-30d26a038a47","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"redditのrustたまに見てるけどrust(ゲーム)の誤爆をしてる人いますねぇ","ts":"1628311974.278400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RB13"}]},{"client_msg_id":"045ae05b-f